AWS S3 Static Website Hosting

Project Overview

This project demonstrates how to host a personal portfolio website using Amazon S3 static website hosting.

The website is built using HTML and CSS and is accessible through the Amazon S3 website endpoint.

Technologies Used

* Amazon S3
* HTML5
* CSS3
* GitHub

Project Structure

AWS-S3-Static-Hosting/
├── index.html
├── style.css
├── README.md
└── screenshots/

Features

* Personal portfolio introduction
* Technical skills section
* Project showcase
* GitHub profile link
* Responsive styling for mobile devices

AWS Implementation

1. Created an Amazon S3 bucket.
2. Uploaded the HTML and CSS files.
3. Enabled static website hosting.
4. Configured the required access permissions.
5. Tested the website using the S3 website endpoint.

